### Get all books
GET http://localhost:3000/books/

### Get one book
GET http://localhost:3000/books/15/












### Add a book
POST http://localhost:3000/books/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "JavaScript Basics",
    "author": "John Smith",
    "price": 350,
    "pages": 250
}











### Update a book
PUT http://localhost:3000/books/11/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "title": "JavaScript Advanced",
    "author": "John Smith",
    "price": 500,
    "pages": 300
}








### Delete a book
DELETE http://localhost:3000/books/12/